{"id":1191,"root":"قلي","bw":"qly","tr":"q-l-y","found":true,"html":"<div class=\"lane-entry\">See Supplement </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\">  <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَلَا</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> and <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قلى</span> </span> <em>He fried</em> wheat; i. e. <em>roasted</em> it <em>in a</em> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَقْلَى</span> [or <em>frying-pan</em> or <em>roasting-pan</em>]. (Mgh.) ― -b2- <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَلَى</span> with <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يَقْلَى</span> for its aor.: see <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَبَى</span>. ― -b3- <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هُوَ يَقْلُو البُرَّ</span>: see <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بَرَى</span>. ― -b4- <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَلَى</span> <em>He roasted in a frying-pan</em> (MA, KL) flesh-meat (MA) or anything: (KL:) and <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شَوَى</span> signifies the same. (MA.) <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَلَى البُرَّ بِالمِقْلَى</span> and <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المِقْلاَةِ</span> means <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شَوَاهُ</span> [i. e. <em>he parched,</em> or <em>roasted, the wheat with the</em> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقلى</span>]. (Mgh.) The aor. is <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يَقْلِى</span> and <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يَقْلُو</span>, and the inf. n. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَلْىٌ</span> (MA, Mgh) and <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَلْوٌ</span>. (Mgh.) </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَلْىٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span>